PDFx for Windows
================

This is a Windows-focused build of PDFx by Alex Gounis:

    https://github.com/AlexandrosGounis/pdfx  (based on commit a8fc12d, v0.2.0+)

PDFx, the .pdfx format and the original application are the work of Alex
Gounis and the upstream contributors; their history is kept in this
repository with authorship intact.

Parts of the Windows features were ported from PDFx Plus for Windows by
Uzair Mohammad (MIT), adapted to the current upstream code:

    https://github.com/Umohammad/pdfx-plus-windows  (commit 55eb554)

Ported or adapted from PDFx Plus: tab bar and workspace colours, context
menu component, "Open with" / Explorer integration and drag-out, the
document details ribbon, import placeholder rows, the export picker, the
counter-scaled document titles and parts of the session storage design.

